  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing human capacities for equality and productivity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will increase knowledge and informed policy discussions in the framework of Agenda 2030 on youth education and trajectories at regional and national level, knowledge on training and qualification for decent work and labour inclusion, and the promotion of the development of competencies for progressive structural change. Promoting gender equality and women&#x2019;s rights is the predominant expected result of various outputs and activities.</narrative>
  </description>
